Z||000000||Eric||11-09-2001||12:57 PM||||New family project finished just this past week.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-288S.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-289S.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-285S.JPG"> <P>I may try to find some more build pictures if any one is interested.  The kit is a Factory Five with independent rear suspension and a carbed 302.  It's a shame that we finished it so late in the year because it's a blast to drive.||||reg||4
